# mcpb pack always excludes .git, .DS_Store, *.mcpb and a handful of JS-tooling files
# (see @anthropic-ai/mcpb's built-in EXCLUDE_PATTERNS) but knows nothing about Python
# bytecode caches, which `build.sh`'s vendoring step leaves behind under server/lib.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.dist-info/RECORD
